{"curationManifestSha256":"8deda35e2cb9b2aae68a6d4e2614684605ec85d50bf2ff9dddd19f7e4588283b","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1751","main":{"annotations":[],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"天下兴亡，匹夫有责。古往今来，众多仁人志士自觉承担匡世济民的责任，积极建言献策，勇于变法图强。他们忧国忧民，心怀天下，坚守道义，敢于担当，令后人崇敬景仰。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"本单元作品文体多样，有直言进谏、警示君主的奏疏，有据理辩争、剖白心迹的书信，有立足现实、评说盛衰的辞赋，有借古讽今、以史为鉴的史论。这些作品思路缜密，表达技巧高超，可以激发我们关注现实，深入思考。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"本单元学习，围绕“倾听理性的声音”这一核心任务展开。要注意领会作者观点及其现实针对性，掌握其解决现实问题的理性思维方式，鉴赏文章的说理艺术，学会在辩证分析与合理推理的基础上进行理性判断，养成大胆质疑、缜密推断的批判性思维习惯。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":288323,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/b/ba4c07905c1cc55998b48df7e7dd26d04115103f.jpeg","height":2386,"id":"media-427298f0f1716f9da551","mediaType":"image/jpeg","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"7aa5a1661443c0ac63fb3c90b2abad840cdb486cceb4eed23995c41c6868acaa","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/b/ba4c07905c1cc55998b48df7e7dd26d04115103f.jpeg","webDisposition":"source-url","width":1701}],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":11202,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/b/ba4c07905c1cc55998b48df7e7dd26d04115103f.jpeg","postId":11202,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/b/ba4c07905c1cc55998b48df7e7dd26d04115103f.jpeg","text":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/b/ba4c07905c1cc55998b48df7e7dd26d04115103f.jpeg","title":null}],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":288323,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/b/ba4c07905c1cc55998b48df7e